      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Impossible to go past DON HUNTER (1) from the ace draw. He made it four from four this time in and took his perfect record at this circuit and distance to seven when he led from the middle of the line and was far too good in the heats. Also came from there for a Group 1 win in the Breeders Challenge 2CG Final prior. He can dictate from this draw and should be a class above. FACET PRINCE (5) made it four placings on the trot when he came from this barrier to be beaten less then 2m last time. Solid behind DON HUNTER in his previous two. Could chase him home again. RISEABOVETHEREST (4) gets his best draw for some time and overcame a wide barrier to win at this circuit and distance last month. WICKED MOTION (7) draws wider than last start but he did well to finish only 3.3m off DON HUNTER there. TIC TIC (9) broke his maiden with a heat win and while drawn wider he has some upside so include.",
